      "content": "I can hear how much pain you're in, and it's okay to stop pretending when the weight feels too heavy to carry alone. The scholarship rejection doesn't erase your parents' love or your worth, but the guilt of being a \"disappointment\" is a cruel lie that only makes you feel smaller. You've already done enough by showing up, even when you feel like a fraud, so please give yourself the grace to rest without the pressure to perform.",
